", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"4b3091d58ff3e881838360e95c14bd3f8ddb9f5734f58f424d295b6fb8d2c6a8","event_uuid":"2ea838a3-96e6-4b65-90eb-489f0fe673b1","position":{"commit_sha":"a486076b00ff3ecc5c88967d269b77a1eabc32e2","position":"1786593310454110001-2ea838a3-96e6-4b65-90eb-489f0fe673b1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Kickoff: executable depth-1 tree has five stories (one already closed, four remaining code/doc leaves). Worktree /Users/joeoakhart/rebar-reb-1538 on branch reb-1538-overlay-derisk from origin/main cc69cc1179. Order: mopey-living-viper, confused-episodic-rat, and clothed-terrazzo-piglet are independent; geode-amazing-peafowl follows mopey-living-viper. Gerrit identity is a Contributor but not a feature-branch driver, so each remaining story will be reviewed, receive LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1, submit to main, close, then the worktree advances before dependent work.","timestamp":1786551064548884001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan gate for mopey-living-viper: first review blocked on missing checklist/testing; remediated. Second blocked on incomplete check-class proof; broadened, then third review correctly found the deterministic unit test could not prove agentic finder behavior and that a blanket b2 waiver was unsafe. Final plan now uses the production eval_solver via rebar criteria eval T10 --runs 3 with balanced fire/no-fire controls plus offline contract tests. A tracker-comment quoting error accidentally invoked the absent eval once; it failed cleanly before any code or ticket-state change and was recorded on the ticket.","timestamp":1786552033649095001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"The fourth plan review blocked only on an unspecified eval gold_set. Remediation now pins a balanced four-item gold_set matching the four dataset scenarios, exact co-located b2 qualifier wording, strict-spec validation, and the offline-test acceptance outcome. Re-review is starting before claim.","timestamp":1786552537554659001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"The fifth planning pass now preserves all four T10 MAJOR safety classes across the transient boundary and wires plan-review-T10 into the actual strict-spec test census. The live oracle is balanced at ten cases, with one positive and one negative family for durable/transient scope plus dedicated destructive-apply, wildcard-admin, plaintext-secret, and endpoint-auth controls.","timestamp":1786553001198350001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"mopey-living-viper received signed plan-review PASS and is now claimed by the configured default assignee. The sole advisory about proving cross-overlay independence will be strengthened in the offline oracle during implementation without changing the attested plan.","timestamp":1786553397656188001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"mopey-living-viper surface census: CLI in scope through rebar explain T10 and repeated rebar criteria eval T10; MCP/API out of scope because this is an internal criterion artifact with no direct tool operation; public library facade out of scope because import rebar exposes no criterion-eval/explain operation; automated plan-review/eval callers in scope through registry loading, eval_solver, and calibration; dual-direction out of scope because this is a read-only prompt/eval artifact with no mirror operation. No contention trigger applies.","timestamp":1786553566708945001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Held-out TDD milestone for mopey-living-viper: full oracle RED 9/9 intended new checks; edge/E2E assertions physically relocated outside the implementation worktree. Happy-only visible oracle RED on exact adjacent scope/safety text and strict packaged-spec loading. Host-pytest collection noise was discarded and rerun correctly with the worktree virtualenv.","timestamp":1786553620790116001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Story mopey-living-viper implementation is complete locally under held-out TDD. Full restored oracle: 35 passed. Defect-seeded mutation proved the corpus oracle rejects a transient wildcard-admin false negative. Live T10 evaluation over the balanced 5-pass/5-finding corpus, three runs per case, achieved recall=1.0, false_accept=0.0, agreement=1.0, kappa=1.0, stability_min=1.0, and stability_mean=1.0. Proceeding through ticket-specific validation and the full repository gates before Gerrit review.","timestamp":1786554535740422001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Story mopey-living-viper cleared all local pre-flight gates: focused tests 35 passed; routing parity OK for 44 criteria; generated guide and CLI explanation validated; lint PASS; typecheck PASS across 509 source files; full test gate PASS with 12,320 passed, 62 expected skips, 264 deselected, zero failures in 41m07s. Proceeding to final diff review, commit validation, and Gerrit review.","timestamp":1786557074785988001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Story mopey-living-viper addressed local code-review advisories before push. Removed a tautological mock metric test; added a RED-first standing-eval scorer contract; corrected the eval gate to use the criterion-finder-appropriate recall and no-fire scorers. The live standing gate is now green across all ten cases and all three epochs: coverage=1.0, epoch_pass=[true,true,true], passed=true. Focused tests, lint, and typecheck remain green.","timestamp":1786558921528557001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Milestone: mopey-living-viper is closed. Gerrit change 1664 landed at mirror commit fc40dbc85055764118ea48bd3bcae26dc4bafc15 after LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments. Completion verification passed all 25 checked acceptance criteria; the normal transition completed and unblocked geode-amazing-peafowl. Residual-gap dispositions are recorded on the story. Next: remediate the independent docs story plan-review finding for the packaged-guide criterion pin consumer, then claim and implement in dependency order.","timestamp":1786564645997365001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Claimed confused-episodic-rat in fresh worktree /Users/joeoakhart/rebar-reb-1538-docs on branch reb-1538-docs from origin/main 72a57c30ab. Signed plan review is certified on the file-impact basis. Landing method remains one independent Gerrit change to main because feature-branch-driver rights are unavailable.","timestamp":1786565250838780001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9d